# Readable text size

Any text a person is expected to read in the biomarker network UI must be at least **14px**.

## Exception

Visualization labels and legends (network node/edge labels, chart axis ticks, color keys on plots) may stay smaller.

## Do not

- Use 10–12px for body copy, headings, summaries, table cell text, form labels, empty states, or error messages.
- Treat summary badges, confidence chips, or metadata lines as “legends” to dodge the 14px floor.
